{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "084ec5ab46e64c5782a966ed0876dfc5ddd34f3dad591232eb77e8659c15581f", "ja": "（今日は情報番組の収録だ。未来はアシスタントと\nして、商品の説明をすることになっている）", "zh": "（今天要录制资讯节目。未来将作为助理，负责介绍商品。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "fd0bfb75f27ad34eb9355d0947b4e4cb930799fdc31907c5354666da8d026f33", "ja": "はいっ！　こちらの商品は、食器を……食器を、\nせん……ちょう？　……ひょう、しろ……。", "zh": "是！这款商品可以将餐具……餐具，清……洗？……漂、漂白……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "5398368f27e942ce47d418c97f09f7ce7e42bacd34640c715c52cd7391e9c643", "ja": "あ、ひょうはく！　できるんです！　えへへ……。\nえ、この次？　ああっ、えっと～、えっとえっと～！！", "zh": "啊，漂白！可以做到的！嘿嘿……\n诶，接下来是什么？啊，那个～，那个那个～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "0fb3c25ae875606bd81f954f844a7b5936cfb6aabe0871db889844ea489efdbc", "ja": "ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん……。\nせっかくのお仕事だったのに……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生……。\n明明是难得的工作，却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "23045f9c394a69a57d7cd8c0a7973c78c0a720b13530098dbd45f8d9de403c80", "ja": "何度も録り直してるうちに、時間なくなっちゃったな。\n最後はもう駆け足で……あのまま放送されるのか……。", "zh": "反复重录的过程中，时间都不够了。\n最后只能匆匆赶完……就那样播出去了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4c0537354abf823a6e418dd24bc1856ba4d3120595db1cc62f0864f45298bbf", "ja": "でも声はよく出てたし、聞きとりやすかったぞ。\nレッスンの成果だな！", "zh": "不过你的声音很响亮，也很清楚。是训练的成果啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "22e9d3e5bfdf95b6a5d5f41a88e6532e6e594e34031c2a1a201e4b248d722eab", "ja": "でも、台本読んだ成果は出ませんでした……。\nうう、ちゃんと読めてなかったんですけど～。", "zh": "可是，读剧本的成果没体现出来……\n呜呜，我根本没好好读嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1008_p", "source_sha256": "09326bec3f3397e4a92cbef13820c2d14ca100806d644e434b0bb3a39e776350", "ja": "（未来、すっかり落ち込んでしまっているな……。\nまあ確かに、かなりの大失敗ではあったけど）", "zh": "（未来，已经彻底消沉了啊……\n不过确实，是一次相当严重的失败呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1009_se", "source_sha256": "e7ae9ac2d689593852ae80c409f77088aa9edf8bf94f87f1f79bb145e9f1b868", "ja": "ピロリン♪", "zh": "叮铃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "b6ce3939820de815f1aefd87b906f8a0aaf09d608b0e381be629c225390e2848", "ja": "あっ、メッセージ。誰だろう……。", "zh": "啊，是消息。会是谁呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "455e974941f8d70b7386b2d6748a69c5c0f79cd2b34c00173713239d2541fa6b", "ja": "お母さん……。あ。やったぁ～！\n{$P$}さん、早く帰りましょう！", "zh": "妈妈……啊，太好了～！\n{$P$}先生，我们快回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e7275e33496dab4344c8e0c2b37151939d275391e2fd1b0ec5f07840fdf9c198", "ja": "おっ、どうしたんだ？\n何かいい知らせがあったみたいだな。", "zh": "哦，怎么了？\n好像有什​​么好消息啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "00a421b0267ea8ba60ec04c66bb1b6e5c49001fa8aec13f5de7971297cf1113c", "ja": "はい！　今日の夕ごはん、カレーみたいです！\nお母さんのカレー、すっごーくおいしいんですよ！", "zh": "是的！今天的晚饭好像是咖喱！\n妈妈做的咖喱，超级好吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9dd2a80f3066c393288c577e2665f82c04bd5813fd571bc74d7eddcfdf38900", "ja": "お父さんも、世界一おいしいって！　いつか\n{$P$}さんも食べに来てくださいね♪", "zh": "爸爸也说这是全世界最好吃的咖喱！以后有机会的话，{$P$}先生也请来尝尝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dd52055383d79e597a0228594a26e46298d01af51d3bc50e5615b715832f5938", "ja": "へえ、そんなにか。じゃあ機会があれば、\nご挨拶にいかせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "哦，有那么好吃吗？那以后有机会的话，我也去拜访一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "b57ae185cd7146ae38208cf6d78362628d88e5198bb026c50e52e8dc12247377", "ja": "ぜったいですよ！　二人ともすっごく喜ぶと思います。\n話はいつも未来から聞いてます～、みたいな感じで♪", "zh": "一定要来哦！他们两个肯定会特别开心的。\n我平时也总是听未来提起你的事～就用这种感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8fa2cc72a9ebef0fc6cd3f28649b90e838505902df556d47755bf11ba14a6419", "ja": "あはは。未来はアイドル活動のこと、\nよくご両親に話すのか？", "zh": "啊哈哈。未来经常会跟父母\n聊起偶像工作的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "6f9d64414bfabfc282138b351237e2a5629a2d0067554cddc0514633f20a3cd9", "ja": "はいっ。仕事が面白かったとかー、歌がうまくなった\n気がするとか、静香ちゃんに怒られたとか、いろいろ。", "zh": "是的！比如工作很有意思啦，感觉唱歌变得更好了啦，还有被静香训了之类的，各种各样的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "3d0a97fe66252a17cd217aaaf48b358c7190d08b3f452592fab97f05006dd1bc", "ja": "今日のお仕事も、朝から応援してくれて……。\nしてくれてたんですけど……。", "zh": "今天的工作，你也从早上开始一直给我加油……  \n确实一直在给我加油，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "fba00ebee2b589641a7db9b2652b2a71216a1a88f8e88a9d3557a97041c5b382", "ja": "はぁ。失敗しちゃった。\nお父さん、がっかりするだろうなー。", "zh": "唉，搞砸了。\n爸爸肯定会失望的吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "6219eb79ff57beea08afe1090338d41575b6ea3d3e6a1896666f759313218121", "ja": "あ、お父さんは私ががっかりしてたら、私よりがっかり\nするんです。わざと話題を変えたり、分かりやすくて。", "zh": "啊，爸爸要是看到我失望了，就会比我还失望。\n还会故意换个话题什么的，太明显了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "bbae04d7e900103dad97c4537666175cd0df95530da95d2d6fafe21d3b2181f2", "ja": "お母さんは、がっかりしててもしてなくても、\nそうなんだ～って言って笑ってくれるんですけどね～。", "zh": "妈妈不管我有没有失望，都会说“这样啊～”，然后笑着陪我呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6ea67e293708bbc72c184e9cb1a04d4f18198945b83263c24aea6626cf8bc088", "ja": "そうか……、なるほど。お父さんもお母さんも、\n本当に未来のこと、応援してくれてるみたいだな。", "zh": "这样啊……原来如此。看来不管是爸爸还是妈妈，都是真的在支持未来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1024_p", "source_sha256": "02106967ef4ea73f625f783bf4863cfc029ec2d6d17271d2dad9a70e763e0799", "ja": "よし、それじゃ未来！\n次はお父さんをガッカリさせないように、頑張ろうか！", "zh": "好，那就这样，未来！接下来，为了不让爸爸失望，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "4010c3910a1a934111ae0ed47fb0bdfb198902493d5358c8a0c2f6a268f6be2f", "ja": "次……あ、そうですよね。またお父さんががっかりして\n部屋をウロウロし始めたら、お母さんも困るし。", "zh": "下次……啊，对哦。要是爸爸又失望了，开始在房间里来回踱步，妈妈也会很为难的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "d2275b89ccda6b29d801420c51e2f0238787117cbc0a1823872f9c25afac545f", "ja": "うん。私、ヘコんでる場合じゃないっ。\n次こそちゃんとできるように、いっぱい練習しますっ！", "zh": "嗯。我可不能垂头丧气的。\n为了下次能好好发挥，我要加倍练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a19dd38e1d46cc7291ba9e0c9589f772c1aba22a2ba73f0a17f858fa78aec75e", "ja": "うん、その意気だ！　で、早速だけど、未来に受けて\nほしいオーディションがあって……。", "zh": "嗯，就是这股干劲！那么，马上就有一场我希望未来参加的试镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef7fc167aee276b20a5d77f07aff3e79948379f18c485f710cb17eed53fe7970", "ja": "わ、ホントですか！　受けます受けますっ。\nどんな番組のオーディションですか？　えっと～。", "zh": "哇，真的吗！我参加我参加！\n是什么节目的试镜？呃～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "cd20cbdb00f82bfc71a7a555372b40d870001d5420e373267838edbfe047f56c", "ja": "『家族バラエティ、大山田家のリビングストーム』\n……わあ、よくわかんないけど面白そうかも！", "zh": "『家庭综艺节目，《大山田家的客厅风暴》』\n……哇，虽然不太明白，但好像会很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1030_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff7f925fba68476e50e395a407e2d3c64121bdff1dc21b1f7fc301d59af46f21", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。お仕事失敗するのも\nオーディション落ちるのも、同じぐらいヘコみます……", "zh": "{$P$}先生……工作失败和选拔落选，都会让我同样沮丧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c3b69f60f8124ecc268c6b79bde951756985b0e05ee62490e904126191b1d39", "ja": "うう、ダメだダメだー！　何でもやるって決めたし、\nヘコんでても仕方ないですよねっ。次こそ、きっと～！", "zh": "呜呜，不行不行——！既然都决定了什么都愿意尝试，\n一直消沉下去也没有用对吧。下次一定要成功～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "2c40c2013297669aab7a9bbc4bf485e50c790d03a9687020fe1ce7596de74ca2", "ja": "ああ、残念だったな。でも、じつはそんなに残念じゃ\nないぞ。未来には、別の役でオファーがあった！", "zh": "啊，真遗憾啊。不过，其实也没那么遗憾。未来收到了出演另一个角色的邀约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_005_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "a1a257b46f724f6ec4cf855eb6339e2aba7627bc6844bdc142dd55d11c05bce8", "ja": "え？　別の役って……、ええっ、ホントですか！？", "zh": "咦？另一个角色是……诶，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
